        <p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-loose text-lg mb-6">If you have ever walked into a gym, stepped onto a basketball court, or scrolled through Instagram, you have likely spotted <strong>ethika</strong>—the bold, colorful sock and underwear brand that refuses to blend in. Known for their signature vibrant patterns, premium cotton blends, and eye-catching designs, ethika has become a cultural staple in athletic wear and street fashion.</p>

